{"title": "Amazon Cargo Plane Crash Kills Five in Miami", "summary": "An Amazon-branded cargo plane overran a runway at Miami airport on Sunday, crashing into multiple vehicles and catching fire. At least five people were killed in the incident. Three individuals were transported to trauma centers in critical condition, and two others received treatment at a local hospital. The cause of the crash is under investigation.", "summary_points": ["An Amazon cargo plane overran a runway at Miami airport on Sunday.", "The plane crashed into multiple vehicles after leaving the runway.", "At least five people were killed in the crash.", "Three people were critically injured and two others were treated for injuries.", "The incident resulted in a fire."], "title_hi": "मियामी में अमेज़न कार्गो विमान दुर्घटना में पांच की मौत", "summary_hi": "रविवार को मियामी हवाई अड्डे पर एक अमेज़न-ब्रांडेड कार्गो विमान रनवे से उतर गया, कई वाहनों से टकरा गया और उसमें आग लग गई। इस घटना में कम से कम पांच लोगों की मौत हो गई। तीन व्यक्तियों को गंभीर हालत में ट्रॉमा सेंटरों में ले जाया गया, और दो अन्य को स्थानीय अस्पताल में इलाज मिला। दुर्घटना के कारण की जांच की जा रही है।", "summary_points_hi": ["रविवार को मियामी हवाई अड्डे पर एक अमेज़न कार्गो विमान रनवे से उतर गया।", "रनवे से उतरने के बाद विमान कई वाहनों से टकरा गया।", "दुर्घटना में कम से कम पांच लोगों की मौत हो गई।", "तीन लोग गंभीर रूप से घायल हुए और दो अन्य को चोटों का इलाज मिला।", "इस घटना के परिणामस्वरूप आग लगी।"], "framing": {"left": ["Emphasized the number of fatalities and critical injuries in the crash.", "Mentioned the disruption to airport operations."], "center": ["Emphasized the number of fatalities and injuries resulting from the crash.", "Highlighted that the aircraft was Amazon-branded.", "Noted the emergency response triggered by the incident."], "right": ["Focused on the dramatic visual of the crash, describing the airport becoming 'full of smoke'.", "Mentioned the plane striking vehicles and catching fire.", "Stated the number of deaths and critical injuries."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["दुर्घटना में हुई मौतों और गंभीर चोटों की संख्या पर जोर दिया।", "हवाई अड्डे पर हुई बाधाओं का उल्लेख किया।"], "center": ["दुर्घटना के परिणामस्वरूप हुई मौतों और चोटों की संख्या पर जोर दिया।", "इस बात पर प्रकाश डाला कि विमान अमेज़न-ब्रांडेड था।", "घटना से उत्पन्न आपातकालीन प्रतिक्रिया को नोट किया।"], "right": ["दुर्घटना के नाटकीय दृश्य पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया, जिसमें हवाई अड्डे के 'धुएं से भर जाने' का वर्णन किया गया।", "प्लेन के वाहनों से टकराने और आग लगने का उल्लेख किया।", "हुई मौतों और गंभीर चोटों की संख्या बताई।"]}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://static.time.com/v3/assets/bltea6093859af6183b/blta1fc004ddfd64356/6a9e2e9b8dcfa84a9ea6eff7/amazon-miami-airport-crash.jpg?branch=production", "sources": [{"source": "CNN", "owner": "CNN", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQYUxKUUpfZndZOW4xUS12NHhITzNWMEN5cGxwMjlCN042VWF5M1diWU9OMXYxVzgtTEFLSGU3eEFZbWJVZTFzaldSSF9NUDhDbEpHVTJ0Y3ZCVUh5ZFFRQlMxTHNrbjBuZzV4dnJLTk1QMDcxZ2hBNXFMZFZvalVuU0RfaU9tQ2lqTTZSR1Q1Tm5nUEc2cTM5UXBfMWVLdw?oc=5", "headline": "Amazon cargo plane overruns runway in Miami"}, {"source": "CNN", "owner": "CNN", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "5 dead after Amazon cargo aircraft overruns runway in Miami, striking multiple vehicles"}, {"source": "Fox News", "owner": "Fox News", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Amazon cargo jet overruns Miami airport runway, triggering massive emergency response"}, {"source": "TIME", "owner": "TIME", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://time.com/article/2026/09/07/miami-airport-plane-overshoot-runway-amazon-cargo", "headline": "What to Know About the Miami Plane Crash That Killed 5 People"}, {"source": "TIME", "owner": "TIME", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/art